  "alconautics.ponder.apparatus.header": "The distillation apparatus and condenser",
  "alconautics.ponder.apparatus.text_1": "Place a fluid tank above a Blaze Burner and fill it with mash.",
  "alconautics.ponder.apparatus.text_2": "A Distillation Head turns the tank into a distillation apparatus. It also pumps the vapour.",
  "alconautics.ponder.apparatus.text_3": "Connect a pipe on top or to either side outlet. Rotate the head with a wrench to aim the side outlets.",
  "alconautics.ponder.apparatus.text_4": "Attach a Steam Whistle to the tank. Heating without one builds pressure and can rupture the apparatus. Superheating builds pressure faster.",
  "alconautics.ponder.apparatus.text_5": "Lead a single continuous pipe route into the top of the Condenser Base.",
  "alconautics.ponder.apparatus.text_6": "Waterlog at least two connected pipes immediately above the condenser. The water surrounds the pipes; vapour travels inside.",
  "alconautics.ponder.apparatus.text_7": "Insert snow or ice into the base with right-click. Cooling consumes this supply; snowflake particles indicate operation.",
  "alconautics.ponder.apparatus.text_8": "Normal heating produces 100 mB every 20 seconds. Superheating reduces the interval to 13 seconds.",
  "alconautics.ponder.apparatus.text_9": "Collect moonshine with glass bottles, or pump it out through any side except the top. A Spout can fill bottles automatically.",
  "alconautics.ponder.apparatus.text_10": "Engineer’s Goggles show the apparatus status, mash level, heating and mash type.",
  "alconautics.ponder.mash_and_dry_chamber.header": "Mash varieties and the Dry Chamber",
  "alconautics.ponder.mash_and_dry_chamber.text_1": "Mix 1000 mB of water, yeast from Farm & Charm and four ingredients in a Basin with a Mechanical Mixer.",
  "alconautics.ponder.mash_and_dry_chamber.text_2": "Use four portions of sugar to make sugar mash.",
  "alconautics.ponder.mash_and_dry_chamber.text_3": "Fruit makes fruit mash. Add four fruits, such as apples.",
  "alconautics.ponder.mash_and_dry_chamber.text_4": "Vegetables make vegetable mash. Add four vegetables: potatoes, carrots or beetroot.",
  "alconautics.ponder.mash_and_dry_chamber.text_5": "Attach a Dry Chamber underneath a pipe between the head and the condenser. It is an optional modifier, not a separate pipe route.",
  "alconautics.ponder.mash_and_dry_chamber.text_6": "Redstone extends the duration of a drink’s positive effect.",
  "alconautics.ponder.mash_and_dry_chamber.text_7": "Glowstone dust grants effect level II for 90 seconds. Choose duration or strength; these modifiers do not stack.",
  "alconautics.ponder.mash_and_dry_chamber.text_8": "One dust treats 1000 mB. Vegetable moonshine has no positive effect to enhance and does not consume the modifier."
}
